2:tier2-source-facets-006:A23", "end_byte": 1733, "interpretation": "Preserve A1 identity.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 1654}, {"document_hash": "sha256:7e8c0d17e78afc93ed267ed2738c4d8d2f739a551f7fe20ff302cecbf8fcd83b", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-006:A23", "end_byte": 3628, "interpretation": "Required assumption A1.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 2085}], "scope": ["supplied input"], "dependencies": [{"id": "D1", "relation": "uses_definition"}], "acceptance_criteria": ["Every supplied input has the specified integer fields, 0 <= n <= 500 and m > 0.", "No additional magnitude bound or sign restriction is imposed on a or b.", "No additional precondition restricts the functional domain."], "origin": "interpreted", "record_digest": "sha256:30d9f8330af6baaa43cc3446e8601c4dd81ed8a8e687e087512a10147c567396", "blocked_by": []}, {"id": "O1", "revision": 1, "kind": "postcondition", "role": "guarantee", "statement": "For every input satisfying A1, the actual admitted solve entry of arity 1 in canonical program.vscore.json returns the exact integer sum_{i=0}^{n-1} floor((a*i+b)/m), with floor toward negative infinity and empty sum 0. Universal source implementation refinement must connect this complete formula to that entry under normative Lean vscore-semantics/0.3 and data-pipeline/0.3. Its mixed source/value formal contract requires typed_total, deterministic, input_preserved, no_external_io, no_floating_point, pure_data and restricted_runtime_only for that exact file and entry.", "required": true, "source_refs": [{"document_hash": "sha256:7e8c0d17e78afc93ed267ed2738c4d8d2f739a551f7fe20ff302cecbf8fcd83b", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-006:A23", "end_byte": 518, "interpretation": "Universal floor-sum formula.", "origin": "explicit", "start_byte": 468}, {"document_hash": "sha256:7e8c0d17e78afc93ed267ed2738c4d8d2f739a551f7fe20ff302cecbf8fcd83b", "document_ref": "tier2:tier2-source-facets-006:A23", "end_byte": 572, "interpretation": "Ne